      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Novena hosts Singapore’s largest concentration of hospitals, including Tan Tock Seng Hospital founded in 1844, one of the oldest in the country.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Novena%2C_Singapore",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "HealthCity Novena, an integrated academic medical complex, centers around Tan Tock Seng Hospital and houses the National Centre for Infectious Diseases and National Neuroscience Institute.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Novena%2C_Singapore",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sun Yat Sen Nanyang Memorial Hall, a museum dedicated to the Chinese revolutionary leader, sits at 12 Tai Gin Rd and offers guided tours of his era.",
